@name     rec_auto_trim_alias
@alias    ra
@group    voice
@c_name   skode_clause_rec_auto_trim_alias_0
@type     immediate
@arity    0
@match    ()
@summary  auto-detect recording buffer trim points (alias)
@doc
Automatically detects recording buffer silence threshold and sets trim points.
Usage: ra
@code
